The only place a weapon enchantment is set is in the case of a sword
dropping at  your feet:

obj->spe=1;   <--- Set enchantment to +1
at_your_feet("A sword");   <--- message about sword at feet

or

at_your_feet(An(swordbuf));   
obj->spe=1;     

The interesting thing here is that it seems as though, if you are
lawful, Excalibur does not yet exist in the game, but are not wielding
a long sword, you don't get Excalibur.  The chaotic (and unposted
neutral) case handles a sword appearing at your feet, but not the
lawful case...  I guess this is in keeping with the theme of Excalibur
being made out of a normal long sword.

